       "hide": null,
       "html": "<div>Hi Everyone! </div><div> </div><div>Sarah Klaus here!  Originally from Colorado, but I now reside in Western Montana, where I teach 4th Grade.</div><div> </div><div>In my free time, I enjoy biking, crafting, napping, and skiing.  I consider myself a semi-professional bad-joke-teller with a long-term life goal of never growing up.</div><div> </div><div>I am honored and excited to Irish-up my summer with Irish Life Experience. I can't wait to meet everyone in a few short weeks!</div>"
      }
